eteness} \\vdash\n\\bigl(\\mathrm{Complete}_R(\\Phi)\n\\land\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_S\\bigr)\n\\to\n\\bigl(\\Phi\\models_S\\varphi\\to\\Phi\\vdash_R\\varphi\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\models_S\">\\(\\models_S\\)</span> : <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span>-语义后承</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vdash_R\">\\(\\vdash_R\\)</span> : 相对于证明演算<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\">\\(R\\)</span>可推导</li>\n<li>该条件式严格实例化<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"3d408f890c399f45\" href=\"?note=3d408f890c399f45\" title=\"88-df-completeness\">88-df-completeness</a>。要断言某个具体 Hilbert、\nGentzen 或自然演绎系统满足前件，必须先另行给出该演算的规则；本书目前\n只有抽象关系<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\">\\(R\\)</span>，因此不能无条件声称任意<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\">\\(R\\)</span>都完备。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"88-df-completeness","status":"resolved","id":"3d408f890c399f45","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-completeness]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-completeness","status":"resolved","id":"3d408f890c399f45","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Complete}_R(\\Phi)$ (relative semantic completeness, see [[88-df-completeness]])","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-completeness","status":"resolved","id":"3d408f890c399f45","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"该条件式严格实例化[[88-df-completeness]]。要断言某个具体 Hilbert、\nGentzen 或自然演绎系统满足前件，必须先另行给出该演算的规则；本书目前\n只有抽象关系$R$，因此不能无条件声称任意$R$都完备。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\Phi,\\varphi","display":false},{"tex":"R","